{"steam_appid":3273260,"steam_name":"Lost Host","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3273260/507833906/ac2000b2e70b3606b55685ca4425bbf958d3f89d/1793092846/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1793095241","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257430473/07d48783dfa5fe6cb443415a8c349cdc5e353600/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1793095241","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/fb695203300a78b298d63930fc4bc122884bc576/ss_fb695203300a78b298d63930fc4bc122884bc576.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794051335","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/9b75b7eaccb6c56de878e1138245faf90669eace/ss_9b75b7eaccb6c56de878e1138245faf90669eace.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794051335","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/7bdf02ab034a15494caa68fbc94573b8bb859d46/ss_7bdf02ab034a15494caa68fbc94573b8bb859d46.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794051335","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/962119b4484e1b46630944dd16beed9abd94b820/ss_962119b4484e1b46630944dd16beed9abd94b820.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794051335","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/a31e5c47875e14148f0857f4307013c82505400f/ss_a31e5c47875e14148f0857f4307013c82505400f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794051335"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can a toy car become the hero of a video game? One night, its owner vanished without a trace. Left alone in the quiet room, this little car sets out on a spooky and mysterious</strong> <strong>journey - to find the boy...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/e5b6fd17d4ccc2d24195982681f02a14.poster.avif?t=1794051335\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/e5b6fd17d4ccc2d24195982681f02a14.webm?t=1794051335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/e5b6fd17d4ccc2d24195982681f02a14.mp4?t=1794051335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you’ll take control of the toy car, solving clever puzzles, navigating tricky challenges, and finding ways to escape the boy’s home. But the journey doesn’t stop there - the car ventures beyond the house into the foggy streets, abandoned places, and many other dark and atmospheric locations, all while chasing clues about the boy's mysterious disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/fd0ba3fc8121fb472931ee8cc588416d.poster.avif?t=1794051335\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/fd0ba3fc8121fb472931ee8cc588416d.webm?t=1794051335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/fd0ba3fc8121fb472931ee8cc588416d.mp4?t=1794051335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The big world outside is full of dangers for a small toy car. Falling from great heights, fire, and water are just some of the perils you’ll face. And there are enemies too - dogs, robotic vacuums, and creepy toy monsters that stand in your way. But don’t worry! You can push, move, and interact with almost anything, thanks to the game’s dynamic physics system, letting you find creative solutions to every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/a7af3bd2ff14ad598fcd7f9885164a37.poster.avif?t=1794051335\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/a7af3bd2ff14ad598fcd7f9885164a37.webm?t=1794051335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/a7af3bd2ff14ad598fcd7f9885164a37.mp4?t=1794051335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This thrilling adventure, packed with spooky yet heartwarming and emotional moments, is a game the whole family can enjoy. Uncover the haunting mystery of the boy’s disappearance - maybe he needs your help more than you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Racing"],"developers":["Gest.LT"],"publishers":["Gest.LT"],"release_date":"Nov 4, 2026"}